---
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Privacy Policy — Navon">
  <header class="page-header">
    <a href="/" class="home-link" aria-label="Navon home">
      <img src="/icon.svg" alt="" width="28" height="28" class="icon" />
      <span class="brand">Navon</span>
    </a>
  </header>
  <section class="page">
    <div class="content">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: June 2026</p>

      <h2>Our commitment</h2>
      <p>
        Navon does not track you. We do not collect personal data, we do not
        use analytics, we do not have advertising, and we do not require
        accounts. The app is designed so that everything works without
        identifying who you are.
      </p>

      <h2>What the app sends to the Navon server</h2>
      <p>
        The companion app contacts the Navon server only when you use HSL
        (Helsinki Region Transport) routing. Those requests contain the
        origin and destination coordinates of your trip so the server can
        relay them to HSL&#8217;s Digitransit API and return route
        alternatives. The requests do not include your identity, a device
        fingerprint, or any persistent identifier.
      </p>

      <h2>Server logs</h2>
      <p>
        The server retains short-term logs (IP address, request path,
        timestamp) solely to detect and prevent abuse of the service. These
        logs are never shared with anyone, never sold, and never used for
        any purpose beyond operations and abuse prevention.
      </p>

      <h2>Third-party services</h2>
      <p>
        Navon relies on independent mapping and routing services to show the
        map and plan routes. When the app sends requests to these services,
        they operate under their own privacy policies and may receive your
        IP address and location data:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>HSL Digitransit (Helsinki Region Transport)</li>
        <li>BRouter (OSM-based bike routing)</li>
        <li>OpenStreetMap and OSRM (map data and routing)</li>
        <li>Apple Maps (map display and routing on iOS)</li>
        <li>Google Maps (map display and routing on Android)</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Navon does not control these services and is not responsible for
        their data practices. We recommend reviewing each provider&#8217;s
        privacy policy if you have questions about how they handle your
        information.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>
        If this policy changes, the updated version will be posted here.
        Because Navon does not collect contact information, we cannot notify
        you directly of changes.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <Footer />
</Base>

<style>
  html {
    scroll-snap-type: none;
  }

  .page-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: var(--space-xl) var(--section-pad-x) var(--space-md);
    background: var(--color-bg);
  }

  .home-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    font-size: var(--text-2xl);
    font-weight: var(--weight-bold);
    color: var(--color-fg);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tight);
    transition: opacity var(--dur-fast) var(--ease-out);
  }

  .home-link:hover,
  .home-link:focus-visible {
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .home-link img {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  }

  .page {
    min-height: auto;
    background: var(--color-bg);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    padding: var(--space-xl) var(--section-pad-x) var(--section-pad-y);
    scroll-snap-align: none;
  }

  .content {
    max-width: var(--content-max);
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-md);
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: var(--text-2xl);
    font-weight: var(--weight-bold);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tight);
    line-height: var(--leading-tight);
    color: var(--color-fg);
  }

  .updated {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--color-fg-dim);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    font-weight: var(--weight-semibold);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tight);
    line-height: var(--leading-snug);
    color: var(--color-fg);
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
  }

  p {
    font-size: var(--text-md);
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
    color: var(--color-fg-muted);
  }

  ul {
    padding-left: var(--space-lg);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-xs);
  }

  li {
    font-size: var(--text-md);
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
    color: var(--color-fg-muted);
  }
</style>
